# Trivy exceptions (tools/quality/trivy-run.sh). One id per line, with `exp:YYYY-MM-DD` after it (the exception lapses
# on that day and the release fails on the finding again). A comment line above each id says why: not affected (and the
# proof), no fix yet, who decided. Empty on purpose: the baseline of 2026-11-09 is in docs/security-scanning.md.
#
# Format:
# <comment: why this finding is accepted>
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
